From 9b912c6f1e145aac338ca14245cd2446fa0d08f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Indr1d-C0ld <102763446+Indr1d-C0ld@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:26:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 09/14] SAGA2: Italian translation of the engine texts

Translate the user interface, status messages, automap labels and the
no-saved-games dialog of the melchior-fta2 restoration build. Plural
object names use "name (count)" instead of appending an English 's'.
The book text buffer grows from 4096 to 16384 characters, because the
translated books are longer than the original ones.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 engines/saga2/document.cpp |   2 +-
 engines/saga2/localize.h   | 156 ++++++++++++++++++-------------------
 engines/saga2/mapfeatr.cpp | 132 +++++++++++++++----------------
 engines/saga2/objects.cpp  |   4 +-
 engines/saga2/uidialog.cpp |   2 +-
 engines/saga2/uitext.h     |  54 ++++++-------
 6 files changed, 175 insertions(+), 175 deletions(-)

